# Secrets must not reach the image. "composer dump-env prod" runs during the
# build and compiles whatever dotenv files it finds into .env.local.php, so a
# .env.local left in the context bakes the host's real passphrases into a layer
# -- and the published image is public. Production is handed its secrets at
# runtime by compose.yaml instead.
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.local.php
.env.test
